    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/017e78cf842c212d00c1633f95816085.poster.avif?t=1753688095\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/017e78cf842c212d00c1633f95816085.webm?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/017e78cf842c212d00c1633f95816085.mp4?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/138f7111e2990fc632ad0ca9e01b1ecd.poster.avif?t=1753688095\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/138f7111e2990fc632ad0ca9e01b1ecd.webm?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/138f7111e2990fc632ad0ca9e01b1ecd.mp4?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Lust Storm</strong> is an adult novel that begins with two girlfriends going on a camping trip but they lose their way in an unexpected storm. Desperate to find shelter, they find a house where a college student is spending the weekend alone in his familie's forest house, studying for his exams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tension between the girls grows, sometimes playful, sometimes intense, the situation slowly turns into a sensual story focused around the student who doesn\u2019t have much experience with women. And with the storm still raging, none of them can leave soon\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/7937239599493af82c962d25e02ec22f.poster.avif?t=1753688095\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/7937239599493af82c962d25e02ec22f.webm?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/7937239599493af82c962d25e02ec22f.mp4?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-8 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes 1-5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and increasingly intense storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 6500\u00a0<u>non-repetitive</u> static images and more than 120 animated scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jaw-dropping sound and visual effects that enhance the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of voyeuristic moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/9b04a58981ea2ab7e6936690585f16d9.poster.avif?t=1753688095\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/9b04a58981ea2ab7e6936690585f16d9.webm?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564820/extras/9b04a58981ea2ab7e6936690585f16d9.mp4?t=1753688095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste